.pio/
build/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
*.o
*.elf
*.map

__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Chip dumps (backups/) ARE committed in the private development repo, by the
# owner's choice: a backup on one disk is not a backup. They hold OWON's
# firmware and a meter's serial number, so the public repo is a squashed
# export without them.

# Third-party files, not ours to redistribute. Each folder's README says
# where to get them; `make setup` checks the image and generates the rest.
firmware/*.bin
docs/manual/*
!docs/manual/README.md
docs/datasheets/*
!docs/datasheets/README.md
docs/fonts/
lib/ui/stock_fonts.h

# Ghidra: project is regenerable with ghidra/run.sh; decomp output is large
ghidra/proj/
ghidra/out/

# Raw footage for the highlight reel (scripts/reel.py): too big for git.
footage/

# Chip dumps: local only in this repo.
backups/*
!backups/.gitkeep
